### Kitchen API Test File
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api (Next.js proxy) or http://localhost:8080/api (direct backend)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@branchId = 1
@orderId = 1

### 1. Get Kitchen Orders (Non-completed orders for branch)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders?branchId={{branchId}}

### 2. Accept Order (Change status to ACCEPTED)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/accept

### 3. Mark Order as Preparing (Change status to PREPARING)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/prepare

### 4. Mark Order as Ready (Change status to READY_TO_SERVE)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/ready

